=========================
cubic_twostage Change Log
=========================

.. current developments

v1.0
====================

**Added:**

* The code is a pip-installable package, ``cubic_twostage``, with the layout of
  ``darmonpoints`` (``pyproject.toml``, Sphinx documentation in ``doc/``, doctests, GitHub
  workflows for tests, lint and documentation).
* ``TwoStage`` works for number fields of any signature with class number one; it is tested
  for real quadratic, complex cubic and totally real cubic fields.  Several fundamental units
  are supported (unit images of centres, local centres, unit residues).
* High level functions: ``TwoStage.find_covering``, ``TwoStage.save_certificate``,
  ``TwoStage.from_certificate``, ``continued_fraction(x)`` for an element of a number field,
  ``verify_certificate``; command line ``cubic-twostage cover|cf|verify``.

**Changed:**

* The pipeline scripts of the paper moved to ``scripts/`` and import the package; the
  first-generation scripts moved to ``legacy/``.
